WEBVTT

00:06.804 --> 00:10.182
<i>There's nothing Yoshikage Kira
despises more…</i>

00:10.224 --> 00:13.936
<i>than being the center of attention.</i>

00:14.020 --> 00:18.520
<i>To suffer such a sickening humiliation
in front of complete strangers…</i>

00:20.109 --> 00:24.609
<i>How could myself-piloting
Heart Attack be ensnared…</i>

00:27.742 --> 00:32.242
Shit… I have to reverse
this witchcraft fast…

00:33.081 --> 00:35.708
Hey there, buddy. You okay?

00:35.750 --> 00:37.710
Not feeling too good?

00:37.752 --> 00:40.337
Want me to call your mommy?

00:41.422 --> 00:43.924
I'm doing fine. Now beat it.

00:45.259 --> 00:47.511
Hey, hey, hey, did you hear that?

00:47.595 --> 00:49.138
Is all that booze making you

00:49.180 --> 00:52.183
dream pretty little dreams
in that head of yours?

00:52.266 --> 00:54.643
Having fun? Enjoying the buzz?

00:54.644 --> 00:55.394
GRASP

00:55.770 --> 00:57.521
Nice suit you got there.

00:57.605 --> 01:00.482
You know, we just got fired
and are flat broke.

01:00.566 --> 01:02.067
The ladies aren't exactly
lining up either.

01:02.110 --> 01:05.780
So when I see guys like you,
I get a little agitated.

01:10.910 --> 01:12.453
Come on, don't just lie there.

01:12.745 --> 01:14.955
Hey, buddy.
Your shoelaces are untied.

01:14.997 --> 01:16.665
I'll tie them for you.

01:20.128 --> 01:22.755
A nice big ol' knot!
Now that's thoughtful!

01:43.151 --> 01:45.486
H-Hey, what's wrong?

01:45.820 --> 01:48.948
That's Deadly Queen's
Bomb Type One.

01:48.990 --> 01:51.450
It turns anything it touches
into a bomb.

01:52.743 --> 01:54.745
Th-The doctor! Call the doctor!

01:54.829 --> 01:57.998
- Today's been a disaster.
- Get me a doctor!

01:58.040 --> 02:02.044
All Yoshikage Kira
wants is a quiet life…

02:02.128 --> 02:06.382
and then those pieces of shit
had to interfere…

02:26.569 --> 02:27.319
JOJO'S BIZARRE ADVENTURE
DIAMOND IS UNBREAKABLE

02:27.320 --> 02:29.447
<i>A demon's crept into
our everyday life</i>

02:29.530 --> 02:31.823
<i>It's about to take away
something precious</i>

02:31.866 --> 02:35.119
<i>Our peace has already
crumbled long ago</i>

02:35.870 --> 02:37.997
<i>So casually, so nonchalantly</i>

02:38.039 --> 02:40.416
<i>It's taken from us
before we know it</i>

02:40.458 --> 02:43.711
<i>If we want it back,
now's the chance</i>

02:43.920 --> 02:47.423
<i>With the sharpness of
the piercing arrow</i>

02:48.216 --> 02:51.636
<i>The beauty of two souls united</i>

02:51.719 --> 02:54.304
<i>Wherever you go, chase you</i>

02:54.388 --> 02:56.515
<i>Whenever, chase you</i>

02:56.557 --> 02:58.600
<i>I will chase you</i>

02:58.643 --> 03:00.269
<i>Nowhere to escape</i>

03:00.353 --> 03:02.938
<i>Start running, I will chase you</i>

03:02.980 --> 03:05.023
<i>Tomorrow, chase you</i>

03:05.066 --> 03:07.777
<i>My fists will be the one
to show you</i>

03:07.985 --> 03:12.485
<i>Tenacity decides
who will win or lose</i>

03:13.699 --> 03:18.199
<i>So I chase you</i>

03:21.374 --> 03:25.211
EPISODE 24
HEART ATTACK, PART 2

03:23.125 --> 03:24.584
Hey, Josuke.

03:24.627 --> 03:25.232
What the hell happened
at that shoe shop?

03:27.129 --> 03:30.632
Got me, but whatever it was,
it wasn't good.

03:30.758 --> 03:33.677
Hurry! It'll take about
five minutes to get there.

03:36.347 --> 03:38.015
It looks cracked.

03:38.099 --> 03:41.977
That must mean
that bomb Stand's user is hurt too.

03:42.353 --> 03:44.855
Please do not venture too far
from my side.

03:45.022 --> 03:47.107
My range is five meters.

03:47.942 --> 03:50.444
Act 3's is five meters.

03:50.486 --> 03:52.654
It is a fact that we have matured.

03:52.738 --> 03:54.990
Our power is even greater
than before.

03:55.032 --> 03:57.826
My inferior range
in comparison with Act 2

03:57.868 --> 03:59.494
is an unavoidable shortcoming.

04:00.246 --> 04:02.665
GRAVITY

04:00.246 --> 04:02.998
Moving outside my five-meter range

04:03.082 --> 04:04.666
removes the weight
applied to the target object,

04:04.709 --> 04:07.169
in effect exciting it
to even greater heights,

04:07.336 --> 04:09.963
and inciting it to rush toward us
like an animal in heat.

04:10.089 --> 04:14.593
Conversely, moving closer
to the target object

04:14.051 --> 04:18.096
GRAVITY

04:14.635 --> 04:17.638
increases the force applied to it.

04:17.722 --> 04:18.118
What would you like to do?

04:19.932 --> 04:22.809
N-Nothing… I want him right there.

04:23.436 --> 04:26.522
I hope Josuke gets here soon.

04:52.298 --> 04:56.798
I hear a new gym is about to open
near Budogaoka High School.

04:57.011 --> 05:00.222
I'm seriously considering joining.

05:00.389 --> 05:03.058
I should probably
build up my strength.

05:03.559 --> 05:07.062
Then again, I could very well
end up lifting the same dumbbells

05:07.146 --> 05:10.440
or swimming in the same pool
as guys who've been busier

05:10.524 --> 05:13.235
playing with their dicks
than bathing.

05:15.571 --> 05:18.156
It took me three minutes
to get here.

05:18.908 --> 05:20.743
I realized the full extent
of my weakness

05:20.785 --> 05:23.579
when I tried to cross
at the crosswalk.

05:24.914 --> 05:29.414
By the way, who else
will be joining us today?

05:31.170 --> 05:33.422
You called on someone for help,
didn't you?

05:33.547 --> 05:37.884
Josuke Higashikata and
Okuyasu Nijimura live the closest.

05:37.927 --> 05:39.261
That's about five minutes away,

05:39.345 --> 05:40.763
so I suppose they have
two minutes to go?

05:40.971 --> 05:43.556
- You're their friend, aren't you?
- Y-You…

05:43.599 --> 05:47.603
Yukako Yamagishi and that woman who
runs Beauty Institute Cinderella

05:47.645 --> 05:50.022
are so-called Stand users
as well, correct?

05:50.064 --> 05:53.442
You wouldn't cry to her for help,
now, would you?

05:53.526 --> 05:55.778
Y-You're…

05:57.571 --> 06:00.448
I left my jacket
with the button behind.

06:01.450 --> 06:03.368
I shall retrieve it later…

06:04.412 --> 06:06.580
After I do away with you.

06:06.622 --> 06:09.666
It's him… right before my eyes!

06:10.126 --> 06:11.669
This is the man…

06:12.169 --> 06:16.669
Year after year,
victim after victim…

06:17.633 --> 06:20.802
Reimi, Shigechi…

06:23.764 --> 06:26.642
Make him suffer, Act 3!

06:23.931 --> 06:26.808
DOGYUUN

06:29.103 --> 06:30.687
Deadly Queen!

06:38.446 --> 06:40.865
Why does he have two Stands?

06:41.157 --> 06:43.409
A person is supposed to have
only one Stand!

06:43.617 --> 06:45.660
Heart Attack is a smart bomb,

06:45.745 --> 06:49.415
which I launch from
Deadly Queen's left hand.

06:49.874 --> 06:53.377
That's why the damage
is confined to my left hand.

06:54.462 --> 06:56.422
Take heed, Master Koichi.

06:56.464 --> 07:00.801
You have just left
the five-meter range.

07:01.010 --> 07:04.013
The force suppressing
his bomb Stand will dissipate.

07:07.641 --> 07:12.141
S-h-i-t.
I must initiate 3 Freeze again.

07:13.189 --> 07:16.400
Fascinating… So it has a range…

07:18.152 --> 07:19.862
To whom shall I direct my attack?

07:19.904 --> 07:23.782
The actual murderer,
or that piece-of-shit bomb Stand?

07:25.326 --> 07:29.371
3 Freeze cannot weigh down
two targets at once.

07:29.830 --> 07:32.040
<i>Even if we immobilize the user,</i>

07:32.124 --> 07:35.252
<i>the bomb Stand will
keep charging on auto-pilot.</i>

07:35.336 --> 07:38.547
<i>If we immobilize the bomb,
the user will rush in for the kill.</i>

07:41.383 --> 07:42.717
Which will it be?

07:42.760 --> 07:44.553
Your orders, please.

07:47.056 --> 07:49.558
To whom shall I direct my attack?

07:50.351 --> 07:52.603
S-Stop the bomb!

07:52.686 --> 07:55.355
3 Freeze!

07:55.022 --> 07:55.939
KER-BAM-BAM

08:00.861 --> 08:03.196
It appears you were
destined for defeat,

08:03.239 --> 08:06.200
irrespective of
your target of attack.

08:06.242 --> 08:10.329
I used to think Heart Attack
was invincible.

08:10.496 --> 08:13.165
To think it would be rendered
completely ineffective…

08:14.333 --> 08:17.294
First I had to compensate
the café for its losses,

08:17.378 --> 08:19.171
then there was the confrontation
with those hooligans.

08:19.213 --> 08:21.924
I feel like I've been
taken for a ride.

08:22.299 --> 08:23.717
This is a major first.

08:23.759 --> 08:26.303
Never have I ever been
so challenged.

08:26.679 --> 08:30.724
I'm even left with
this slight taste of defeat.

08:31.392 --> 08:33.685
My deepest respects.

08:33.936 --> 08:36.605
You are something else… boy.

08:37.940 --> 08:41.777
By the way, you wouldn't happen
to have any tissues, would you?

08:41.861 --> 08:43.404
Or a handkerchief is fine.

08:44.864 --> 08:48.284
Hm? I paid you my respects.

08:48.492 --> 08:51.203
You could at least
converse with me.

08:51.537 --> 08:53.455
I have… none.

08:53.539 --> 08:56.375
Then use mine.

08:59.962 --> 09:02.339
Your nose is gushing blood,
isn't it?

09:02.756 --> 09:04.966
I offered so you could
clean yourself up.

09:05.092 --> 09:07.719
I'm about to end your life
by mauling.

09:07.761 --> 09:11.723
I have a little over a minute
before your friends get here.

09:11.891 --> 09:14.977
Leaving you alive
just doesn't sit right with me.

09:15.060 --> 09:17.979
Especially after
that public humiliation.

09:19.940 --> 09:24.110
Hey, hey, you can stop
that ridiculous groaning now.

09:24.445 --> 09:26.780
I endured the same pain
you feel now

09:26.822 --> 09:31.322
through recent events,
but I didn't complain.

09:32.119 --> 09:33.870
You sure you are a boy?

09:35.831 --> 09:38.834
You should learn by my example.

09:40.502 --> 09:43.713
See? Tissues come in hand,
don't they?

09:45.424 --> 09:46.883
I'll dab the blood for you.

09:46.967 --> 09:51.304
They say a stuffed up nose
leads to slowed cognition.

09:51.388 --> 09:53.932
You know, not long ago,

09:53.974 --> 09:57.435
I was groveling on the floor
just like you.

09:57.603 --> 10:01.273
In one minute, I will vaporize you
with Deadly Queen.

10:01.398 --> 10:03.316
Until that moment, I suggest
you learn from yours truly

10:03.359 --> 10:05.361
and take the pain.

10:05.819 --> 10:08.696
Learn to be tough
in the face of resistance!

10:15.829 --> 10:19.040
Y-Your name…

10:19.083 --> 10:22.961
is Yoshikage Kira…

10:25.005 --> 10:29.505
Yoshikage Kira is your real name…

10:32.596 --> 10:34.306
My driver's license!

10:34.348 --> 10:36.850
When did you swipe my wallet?

10:37.017 --> 10:39.102
You little pathetic turd…

10:39.186 --> 10:43.686
You said you had to
reimburse the café, right?

10:44.024 --> 10:46.985
That's when it hit me.

10:47.820 --> 10:49.738
What does that have to do
with anything?

10:49.822 --> 10:53.158
What good does it do you
to know my name?

10:53.200 --> 10:55.410
In a matter of moments,
you will cease to exist.

10:55.452 --> 10:59.581
Yeah, I know you're
about to kill me.

10:59.665 --> 11:04.165
But even I was able to
figure out your name.

11:04.753 --> 11:08.131
You're not so tough.

11:08.257 --> 11:12.135
You might get away for now,
but I wonder what you're thinking?

11:12.219 --> 11:15.513
A little pathetic turd just
unravelled the mystery of your name

11:15.556 --> 11:17.307
without breaking a sweat.

11:18.058 --> 11:20.060
I'll say it again.

11:20.102 --> 11:23.522
A little pathetic turd
just found you out!

11:24.314 --> 11:26.316
You're the biggest dumb ass
I've ever seen!

11:26.483 --> 11:29.986
I'll be waiting for you
on the other side, son of a bitch!

11:30.070 --> 11:32.614
You bastard!

11:34.742 --> 11:38.996
Damn it! Why do I feel like
the one who's lost?!

11:46.795 --> 11:49.506
REVERB ACT 3
KOICHI HIROSE

11:49.798 --> 11:51.716
Infuriating brat.

11:51.800 --> 11:56.300
I still have a minute before
Josuke and Okuyasu show up.

11:58.474 --> 12:02.974
And here I thought roughing him up
would settle my spirit.

12:04.104 --> 12:07.315
He's got his socks on inside-out.

12:07.399 --> 12:09.526
I suppose it doesn't bother him…

12:14.948 --> 12:17.450
That's it, I can't stand it!

12:20.746 --> 12:22.456
Not that way, Okuyasu!

12:22.498 --> 12:24.166
But Centipede Shoes is this way.

12:24.249 --> 12:26.834
If we go this way, we'll get there
in a minute! Hurry up!

12:31.423 --> 12:33.341
Put them on right.

12:38.972 --> 12:40.640
That gnawing unease is gone.

12:41.225 --> 12:44.186
And now I can scatter
your atoms like dust!

12:44.520 --> 12:46.230
Deadly Queen!

12:46.313 --> 12:50.191
The tip of this finger can
transform any object into a bomb.

12:50.400 --> 12:53.986
I suppose, in your case,
it will be your student badge.

12:55.322 --> 12:57.032
Bomb Type One!

12:59.868 --> 13:04.368
Koichi, your spirit has prevailed.

13:06.834 --> 13:07.918
What?!

13:15.259 --> 13:16.677
Well, what a surprise.

13:16.718 --> 13:18.010
I wouldn't have guessed
you'd be able to

13:18.053 --> 13:19.888
prop yourself up
with those injuries…

13:20.347 --> 13:22.640
You would've been much better off

13:22.683 --> 13:24.601
entering
your eternal slumber there.

13:25.018 --> 13:27.020
In fact, I think I can see
the trees behind you

13:27.062 --> 13:29.230
through those gapping wounds.

13:30.023 --> 13:31.524
Nice watch you got there.

13:32.484 --> 13:36.362
Take one last look cause
I'm gonna bust it up real good…

13:37.322 --> 13:39.907
By it I mean your face.

13:41.034 --> 13:43.911
You certainly are
an intriguing individual.

13:44.204 --> 13:47.248
I'd love to learn your name,
among other things,

13:47.332 --> 13:49.792
but I really must mosey on
to my next destination.

13:50.210 --> 13:52.462
I have a mere twenty seconds left.

13:53.380 --> 13:56.591
Mindless small talk
just isn't on the agenda.

14:00.345 --> 14:04.432
Your Stand just now
was surprisingly feeble.

14:04.516 --> 14:07.894
Like catching a simple pop fly.

14:08.729 --> 14:13.229
Do you really think your frailty
can overcome Deadly Queen's power?

14:17.237 --> 14:18.154
SMASH

14:19.448 --> 14:20.323
<i>Wh—</i>

14:21.074 --> 14:22.825
<i>S-Such speed…</i>

14:24.077 --> 14:26.954
How can you move so fast?

14:27.247 --> 14:31.747
Now that I got a closer look…
Good grief, that's a tacky watch.

14:32.127 --> 14:35.630
Though, that's the least
of your worries now…

14:36.256 --> 14:39.092
I can think of something
that's gonna look a lot worse…

14:39.801 --> 14:42.136
and that something is your face.

14:51.939 --> 14:54.358
<i>What is this Stand?</i>

14:54.441 --> 14:57.569
<i>It's so fast… like it stopped time!</i>

15:06.286 --> 15:10.786
Koichi, if it weren't for you,
I would have been long dead.

15:11.792 --> 15:15.045
You fought valiantly, without
anyone to help you by your side.

15:15.629 --> 15:18.006
You deserve great respect, Koichi.

15:19.633 --> 15:21.134
You've matured.

15:34.189 --> 15:35.899
Hey, Koichi!

15:35.983 --> 15:37.359
Koichi!

15:39.653 --> 15:43.823
W-What the heck happened?

15:45.742 --> 15:49.328
K-Koichi! Jotaro!

15:50.122 --> 15:52.040
Be on the lookout, Okuyasu.

15:52.416 --> 15:56.711
What in the hell happened?!
Jotaro! Koichi!

15:56.753 --> 16:00.131
Calm down. I have to
find out if Koichi is still alive.

16:00.173 --> 16:03.176
If he is, I can heal him
with Shining Diamond.

16:03.719 --> 16:07.931
Yes! Jotaro's alive!
But just barely.

16:08.348 --> 16:10.850
K-Koichi is too.
But he's not breathing!

16:10.934 --> 16:13.519
Hurry! Hurry and heal him, Josuke!

16:13.687 --> 16:15.772
Hey, he's not waking up!

16:15.856 --> 16:17.065
<i>- I can't believe it…</i>
- But he should be healed.

16:17.149 --> 16:19.901
<i>- Josuke and Okuyasu are here.</i>
- He's hurt bad!

16:19.985 --> 16:21.736
It's gonna take him a while
to come to.

16:21.820 --> 16:23.571
<i>Today has been utter hell…</i>

16:23.655 --> 16:27.075
<i>Never have I lived through
such a horrible day.</i>

16:29.995 --> 16:34.495
<i>Yoshikage Kira has always
been able to overcome anything…</i>

16:36.001 --> 16:39.671
<i>I'll get out of this… I will.</i>

16:40.130 --> 16:41.589
What are you doing?

16:42.758 --> 16:44.801
Hey, he's awake.

16:44.885 --> 16:48.972
Hey, don't try anything funny.

16:49.222 --> 16:53.226
Turn around very slowly.
Show us your face!

16:56.480 --> 16:59.941
Be careful!
Stay away from Centipede Shoes!

17:00.025 --> 17:02.610
Some crazy explosion
is about to go off!

17:03.737 --> 17:06.573
The owner was
blown into the street!

17:06.615 --> 17:07.824
Those two were too!

17:09.076 --> 17:10.285
An explosion?

17:10.369 --> 17:13.622
H-Hey, calm down.
Were you caught in the blast?

17:13.914 --> 17:16.291
I'm just an office worker.

17:16.333 --> 17:20.086
But I'm not gonna make it…
I'm losing too much blood.

17:20.295 --> 17:22.380
I-It hurts!

17:22.422 --> 17:25.800
H-Hey, calm down.
It's gonna be all right.

17:25.884 --> 17:27.802
I can heal you.

17:28.887 --> 17:30.805
Where does it hurt?

17:31.306 --> 17:34.809
I think one of my ribs
might have punctured my lung.

17:37.396 --> 17:39.731
H-Hurry, save me, please!

17:40.190 --> 17:41.232
Hurry?

17:41.608 --> 17:46.108
Oh? Last I checked, I looked like
I was still just in high school,

17:46.321 --> 17:48.239
so why would you ask me
to treat your wounds?

17:49.950 --> 17:53.578
I have trouble getting into
pachinko parlors,

17:53.829 --> 17:57.958
and I look like some
med-school graduate to you?

18:00.293 --> 18:02.003
You totally took the bait.

18:02.087 --> 18:05.131
You saw my Shining Diamond,
didn't you?

18:05.632 --> 18:07.967
<i>Crap… I got too excited</i>

18:08.718 --> 18:10.845
Which means you're the enemy.

18:11.096 --> 18:12.806
What we've got here
is a double knockout.

18:15.517 --> 18:18.686
Th-This guy's the murderer?!

18:19.604 --> 18:22.523
I guess this means I've lost.

18:22.649 --> 18:27.028
You're right, I'm the one
you've been looking for.

18:27.320 --> 18:31.449
You know my identity,
the true nature of my Stand,

18:31.658 --> 18:33.576
you even know my real name.

18:33.660 --> 18:37.789
I guess sleeping like a baby
isn't really in the cards…

18:38.039 --> 18:39.957
I mean, of course, for tonight!

18:40.292 --> 18:41.793
Deadly Queen!

18:49.926 --> 18:51.510
What the hell are you doing?!

18:51.553 --> 18:54.389
Exactly what it looks like.
I severed my own hand.

18:54.681 --> 18:59.181
I-It hurts… It hurts so bad,
so much blood.

18:59.352 --> 19:01.187
Look at me, I'm crying.

19:01.521 --> 19:04.815
To me, victory and defeat
means nothing.

19:05.025 --> 19:06.735
I assure you I will survive.

19:06.818 --> 19:08.861
I will live on
in peaceful tranquility.

19:08.987 --> 19:13.449
I have to live with
the insatiable desire to kill,

19:13.533 --> 19:16.410
but I promise you,
I will live happily ever after!

19:17.037 --> 19:20.415
Heart Attack, you are free!

19:20.499 --> 19:22.125
I leave the rest to you.

19:22.209 --> 19:24.085
Your duty is to protect me.

19:24.127 --> 19:26.462
Well look at
this cute little plaything…

19:26.546 --> 19:30.424
Josuke, that's a bomb Stand,
and it goes after thermal energy!

19:30.467 --> 19:32.343
It's completely indestructible!

19:32.552 --> 19:35.346
Your body temperature
will set it off!

19:38.058 --> 19:40.143
So you can't bust it to pieces?

19:41.895 --> 19:43.354
Bust it to pieces?

19:43.897 --> 19:46.649
Quite the contrary. I fixed it.

19:47.317 --> 19:49.944
With his hand left behind…

19:52.906 --> 19:54.616
It's not the prettiest sight
to look at,

19:54.658 --> 19:56.576
but the hand is leading us
to our murderer.

19:56.618 --> 19:57.368
Let's go!

19:57.410 --> 19:58.744
Yeah!

19:58.912 --> 20:02.457
You're not getting away
that easily, freakin' crackpot!

20:03.250 --> 20:06.002
H-Hey, look over there…

20:08.213 --> 20:12.713
I will sleep peacefully again…

20:13.718 --> 20:17.847
K-Kira? Why is your face
caked in blood?

20:18.014 --> 20:21.392
Hey, guys.
Time to head home already?

20:23.103 --> 20:26.147
I'm in a hurry, later then.

20:28.275 --> 20:30.318
The murderer's name is
Yoshikage Kira.

20:30.402 --> 20:33.488
His address is
Morioh Kotodai 1 -128.

20:33.572 --> 20:34.990
He's 33 years old.

20:35.031 --> 20:38.617
He wields a short-range bomb Stand,
Deadly Queen!

20:38.952 --> 20:42.038
Hey, where is this guy running to?

20:42.289 --> 20:46.334
It doesn't matter where. He's dead!

20:48.628 --> 20:50.338
He's in this building.

20:50.380 --> 20:53.007
Hey, wait… This is…

20:53.300 --> 20:55.385
Beauty Institute Cinderella!

20:55.885 --> 20:58.012
What's he doing here?!

20:59.639 --> 21:02.266
A-Aya! Are you there?

21:02.976 --> 21:04.602
Dr. Aya Tsuji!

21:17.198 --> 21:19.283
A-Aya's…

21:19.784 --> 21:21.160
Aya's…

21:21.911 --> 21:25.497
What is this?
What the hell happened?!

21:25.665 --> 21:30.165
He's dead…
Why is Yoshikage Kira dead?

21:30.837 --> 21:31.879
Aya!

21:31.963 --> 21:33.422
Th-This is…

21:33.590 --> 21:36.217
What the hell happened?

21:39.763 --> 21:42.432
Wait!
That man isn't Yoshikage Kira!

21:42.515 --> 21:43.557
He has his left hand!

21:43.850 --> 21:44.851
Huh?

21:47.687 --> 21:50.022
His face is missing!

21:50.065 --> 21:50.899
What?!

21:50.940 --> 21:52.775
He's missing his fingerprints
on his right hand, too.

21:52.859 --> 21:54.861
Who is this guy?

21:55.070 --> 21:55.945
That man…

21:56.863 --> 22:00.199
That man has
the same height and build…

22:02.035 --> 22:06.535
That man was brought here by him,
he killed him right before my eyes.

22:08.750 --> 22:11.043
He's too terrible for words…

22:11.711 --> 22:14.755
He made me use Cinderella
to replace his face.

22:15.715 --> 22:18.759
And his hair and fingerprints…

22:18.843 --> 22:21.095
So he's someone else now?

22:21.137 --> 22:22.221
Yes…

22:22.263 --> 22:24.181
H-His face…

22:24.891 --> 22:26.142
Shining Diamond!

22:26.518 --> 22:27.769
H-His…

22:29.396 --> 22:32.232
Josuke, don't touch her! Get away!

22:32.565 --> 22:34.233
His face…

22:41.366 --> 22:43.117
Aya!

22:45.912 --> 22:47.413
On the other side of that door!

22:47.455 --> 22:49.623
You're not getting away, damn it!

22:52.585 --> 22:54.128
Th-This is…

22:58.717 --> 23:01.344
I-It's the commute home…

23:02.554 --> 23:04.055
There's so many people…

23:04.097 --> 23:07.809
W-Which one is he?
Which one is Yoshikage Kira?!

23:09.436 --> 23:13.936
Yoshikage Kira, you gutless prick!
Get out here!

23:16.067 --> 23:18.069
He managed to get away.

23:18.361 --> 23:21.155
He won't be afraid,
and he won't be hiding.

23:21.614 --> 23:24.158
You can bet he will stay
right here in Morioh.

23:24.242 --> 23:27.328
He'll go on living
as he always has.

23:27.579 --> 23:32.079
AYA TSUJI: DECEASED
YOSHIKAGE KIRA'S METAMORPHOSIS,
A NEW FACE, A NEW NAME,
A NEW ADDRESS

23:27.787 --> 23:29.497
<i>Aya Tsuji: deceased</i>

23:29.539 --> 23:30.831
<i>Yoshikage Kira's metamorphosis,</i>

23:30.915 --> 23:34.460
<i>a new face, a new name,
a new address</i>

23:38.798 --> 23:42.009
EPISODE 25
HEART FATHER
